program	set_literal_not_hashable_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	set element type `NoHash` must be `Hashable` (map keys and set elements require Hashable + Equatable)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: set element type `NoHash` must be `Hashable` (map keys and set elements require Hashable + Equatable)"
